# wip121: FX button, last page = COMP: the master compressor, Glue style: needle meter (gain reduction, 0 .. 20 dB) and four knobs:
# K1 ATTACK, K2 RELEASE, K3 THRESHOLD, K4 MAKEUP. The ratio stays 4:1. MST pots: .0 THRESH .1 RATIO .2 ATTACK .3 RELEASE .4 MAKEUP .6 PUMP.
# Default = nothing compressed (threshold 0 dB, makeup 0, pump 0) with the drum-bus voicing ready: 30 ms attack, 120 ms release (a 16th at 120-130 BPM).
wait 300
preset presets/01_Marchiav.tnp
expect preset_rc 0
expect sound5.0.0 127
expect sound5.0.1 4
expect sound5.0.2 105
expect sound5.0.3 63
expect sound5.0.4 0
expect sound5.0.6 0
# wip129: the FX cycle is MIX, PERFORM, REVERB, DELAY, MIX (no COMP); COMP is GLO page 2 (GLO: mixer, COMP, settings)
# wip223: FX short = MIX, PERFORM; HOLD FX = REVERB, HOLD HOME = DELAY; a short FX from there = MIX
tap FX
expect view 9
tap FX
expect fxpage 0
press FX
wait 700
release FX
wait 100
expect fxpage 1
press HOME
wait 700
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 2
tap FX
expect view 9
tap GLO   # wip290: 1st press = VEL
expect view 15
tap GLO
expect view 3
tap GLO
expect view 4
shot comp_default.png
# default: it plays, nothing is squeezed
tap PLAY
wait 4000
expect grdb10 <3
shot comp_off_playing.png
# THRESHOLD (K3) down: the meter moves; the other knobs
turn K3 -30 80
expect sound5.0.0 <100
turn K1 -4 80
expect sound5.0.2 <105
turn K1 4 80
turn K2 3 80
expect sound5.0.3 >63
turn K4 5 80
expect sound5.0.4 >0
shot comp_knobs.png
# a drum-bus setting: -16 dB, 30 ms, 120 ms, +4.5 dB: some gain reduction while it plays
param 5 0 0 85
param 5 0 2 105
param 5 0 3 63
param 5 0 4 24
wait 4000
expect grdb10 >5
shot comp_working.png
# the ratio is untouched, and the page goes on to MIX
expect sound5.0.1 4
tap PLAY
tap FX
expect view 9
